#: {{ux|en|Jerry is a '''financial''' member of the club.}}

====Usage notes====
Not to be confused with {{m|en|fiscal}}, which means more narrowly “[[pertaining]] to a [[treasury]], particularly to government spending and revenue”, rather than to money generally.

